WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.333
Welcome to the Man of Recaps,

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:03.600
this is Wheel of Time, Season one.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.266
Our story begins in the quaint
little village of Two Rivers,

00:00:06.266 --> 00:00:08.166
where we follow a group of five young friends.

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:10.500
There's Rand the Shepherd, Perrin the blacksmith,

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.800
and Matt, the degenerate gambler - slash - thief.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.966
Egwene has just come of age
and gotten her classic two Rivers braid.

00:00:15.966 --> 00:00:17.800
And just a few years older is Nynaeve,

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.666
The village Wisdom,
like the Medicine Woman,

00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:22.866
And she's hoping to take Egwene as an apprentice 
because they can do a little bit of magic.

00:00:22.866 --> 00:00:25.500
But tonight, the Two Rivers gets a visit
from a woman, Moiraine,

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.966
who is a real wizard!
In this world they call it an Aes Sedai

00:00:28.966 --> 00:00:31.833
They don’t call it magic,
they call it channeling the One Power,

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:36.000
And the Aes Sedai, the official group of sorceresses,
are respected and feared.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.933
Now this world thinks of time,
not linearly, but as the Wheel of Time,

00:00:38.933 --> 00:00:41.266
because it's all about cycles
and reincarnation.

00:00:41.266 --> 00:00:44.333
Moiraine is following up on a prophecy
that a youngster from this village

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:48.266
would be a reincarnation of a legendary figure,
The Dragon Reborn.

00:00:48.266 --> 00:00:50.733
Problem is all five of them could fit the prophecy,

00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:54.000
and it's clear they're all Ta'veren,
people that are super important to fate.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.866
Now tonight’s a big festival at the Two Rivers,

00:00:55.866 --> 00:00:58.800
so the peddler Padan Fain comes to town
- more on him later.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.600
And everyone's having a great time
until party crashers arrive!

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:04.800
Oh yeah it's the Trollocs,
these like, Minotaur monsters.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.400
Luckily, there's an Aes Sedai here
to blast them all with some magic.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.600
And Moiraine’s traveling with
her Warder, Lan,

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.500
who's a great warrior,
there to watch her back.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.033
A Trolloc busts in to Rand’s house,

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:15.300
but Rand’s dad pulls out his sword from under the bed,

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.533
and oh, he's no normal shepherd,
he's a master swordsman!

00:01:17.533 --> 00:01:20.033
Perrin grabs an axe, he and his wife
are fighting Trollocs together,

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.666
but he goes into a frenzy
and oh, hits her!

00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:25.300
No, killed his own wife!
That's traumatizing.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.733
In the end the village is mostly saved,

00:01:26.733 --> 00:01:28.400
except Nynaeve, who gets captured.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.700
So Moiraine fills these kids in,
the Dark One is hunting you,

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:32.666
because one of you is the Dragon Reborn,

00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:34.700
so they gotta go off on an adventure.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:37.233
But the Trollocs are hot on their tails,
so they take shelter for a night

00:01:37.233 --> 00:01:40.633
in this old ruined city that the Trollocs
won't enter because it's cursed!

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:43.300
Shadar Logoth, the City of Shadow.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:46.000
Don’t worry, we’ll be fine,
as long as no one touches anything...

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.000
But Matt immediately grabs
the obviously cursed dagger.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.166
So the shadow wakes up
and now it's hunting them,

00:01:51.166 --> 00:01:53.133
Everyone escapes,
but they're all separated.

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:54.700
Randy and Matt make it to a nearby village

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.233
where they befriend the bartender,
but oh, she's here to capture them!

00:01:57.233 --> 00:01:59.166
Yes she's a “Dark Friend”, a person who’s

00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:02.366
working for The Dark One in hopes of eternal reward.

00:02:02.366 --> 00:02:04.633
But there's a Gleeman in town,
a traveling bard,

00:02:04.633 --> 00:02:07.133
and this one's Thom Merrilin,
an older rocker type.

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:08.433
And he's a great knife thrower,

00:02:08.433 --> 00:02:10.500
saves these guys like,
let's get out of here.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.133
They seek shelter at a nearby farmhouse,

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:14.033
But oh, what's this?
The whole family's been killed!

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.166
And maybe it was Matt
with his cursed dagger...

00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:19.766
But more likely it was this Nazgul
Voldemort guy called a Fade.

00:02:19.766 --> 00:02:21.766
Who are The Dark One’s top lieutenants.

00:02:21.766 --> 00:02:24.133
Thom Merrilin stays behind to fight it
so the boys can escape.

00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:26.200
Egwene and Perrin are rescued
by a travelling people

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.066
called the Tuatha’an,
or more commonly, just the Tinkers.

00:02:29.066 --> 00:02:31.600
They follow a pacifist philosophy
called The Way of the Leaf,

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.133
because even in self-defense,
violence is always bad.

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:36.266
And this resonates with Perrin
who is still traumatized

00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:37.900
by having accidentally
killed his own wife.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.200
But now they have a run in
with the Children of the Light.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:41.933
We met some before
they’re a religious order,

00:02:41.933 --> 00:02:44.100
like the Knights Templar,
committed to doing good.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.400
except the Questioner,
Eamon Valda, who's a real bad dude,

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.700
hunting down all Aes Sedai
and like keeping their rings as trophies.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:53.066
He recognizes Egwene and Perrin
as suspicious characters,

00:02:53.066 --> 00:02:55.766
So the Tinkers stand up to defend them,
with no violence...

00:02:55.766 --> 00:02:57.633
Which obviously doesn't work
and they're captured.

00:02:57.633 --> 00:02:59.400
He thinks Egwene is a secret Aes Sedai,

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.900
and indeed, she can channel the one power!
Though she still need some training.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.100
But Perrin has some unexpected powers
of his own

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.500
as like a lot of wolves
have been hanging around him lately,

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.900
and now his eyes turn yellow,
he gets super strength!

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.566
And now a whole pack of wolves
attack the camp and they escape.

00:03:12.566 --> 00:03:15.166
Meanwhile, Lan and Moiraine
met up with Nynaeve

00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:17.233
who is a huge badass
and managed to escape.

00:03:17.233 --> 00:03:19.233
And she doesn't trust anyone,
especially Moiraine,

00:03:19.233 --> 00:03:21.100
But Lan convinces her
they're on the same side.

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:24.233
They meet up with some more Aes Sedai,
led by Moiraine’s rival, Liandrin.

00:03:24.233 --> 00:03:27.800
And they’ve just captured a man who could channel,
and claimed to be the Dragon Reborn.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:29.333
Yes the Aes Sedai are all women

00:03:29.333 --> 00:03:33.233
because the male half of the One Power
was corrupted by The Dark One,

00:03:33.233 --> 00:03:35.566
Any man who channels goes insane.

00:03:35.566 --> 00:03:38.066
And so the Red Aes Sedai
hunt down these men and “still” them,

00:03:38.066 --> 00:03:39.833
cutting them off from the Power permanently,

00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:41.633
but that leaves them
a shell of a human being.

00:03:41.633 --> 00:03:45.266
And regarding the Dragon Reborn, it's
uncertain if they're a hero or a villain,

00:03:45.266 --> 00:03:47.200
The original Dragon “broke the world.”

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.933
Official Aes Sedai policy
is snuff out any potential Dragons,

00:03:49.933 --> 00:03:51.600
So Moiraine’s keeping her kids a secret.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.166
But this guy, Logain,
is a real powerful channeler,

00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:56.466
Breaks free of his cage and kills
everyone in the room.

00:03:56.466 --> 00:03:58.766
But Nynaeve busts in
and she's even stronger,

00:03:58.766 --> 00:04:01.533
unleashes a huge blast of magic
to heal everyone!

00:04:01.533 --> 00:04:03.733
And the rest of the Aes Sedai
are able to Still this guy.

00:04:03.733 --> 00:04:05.900
So our groups all separately
make it to Tar Valon,

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:09.333
the big city in the area and home
to the Aes Sedai’s White Tower.

00:04:09.333 --> 00:04:12.800
And Moiraine has to report to the
Aes Sedai’s leader, the Amyrlin Seat

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:15.700
and it's against the rules that Moiraine’s
not telling anyone what she's up to,

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:17.900
so publicly the Amyrlin Seat
has to chastise her.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.333
But privately Moiraine goes to her room,

00:04:19.333 --> 00:04:21.700
and these two are old friends -
in fact, they're lovers!

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.300
She and Moiraine are the only ones
that know the secret prophecy

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.366
that the Aes Sedai aren’t supposed
to fight the Dragon Reborn,

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:28.800
They're supposed to fight *with*
the Dragon Reborn to save the world.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.933
But I guess that info wouldn't be accepted,
so they have to work behind the scenes.

00:04:31.933 --> 00:04:34.666
So the Amyrlin Seat pulls out
the unbreakable vow rod,

00:04:34.666 --> 00:04:36.966
and banishes Moiriane from the White Tower!

00:04:36.966 --> 00:04:40.100
But of course that's exactly what they wanted,
so Moiraine can continue her quest.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:42.700
The Dark One is escaping his
prison at the Eye of the World,

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:46.000
and so whichever one of you is the Dragon
has to go there and strengthen the seal.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.533
And they can get there real fast
by traveling through the magic door,

00:04:48.533 --> 00:04:51.200
But wait, what's this?
Matt is staying behind!

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.066
Yes he's been getting
progressively more cursed,

00:04:53.066 --> 00:04:56.333
And finally Moiraine was able to get that
curse out of him, put it back in the dagger.

00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:59.800
But he’s still not feeling this whole adventure,
so he's just going to stay behind.

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:02.833
Now, “The Ways” are an ancient
magic pathway built by the Ogier,

00:05:02.833 --> 00:05:06.100
a race of nature people who
live a long time so move real slow.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.700
This one, Loial, is traveling with them
to help them navigate,

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.666
but it's all been corrupted, The Dark One’s 
moving his Trollocs through here!

00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:14.700
And worse than Trollocs is 
Machin Shin, the Black Wind,

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.200
that like, uh, whispers all 
your worst fears into your head.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.700
But Nynaeve resists it
through the power of stubbornness,

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.966
and holds this thing back 
so they can all escape.

00:05:21.966 --> 00:05:24.866
They're at the fortress city
of Fal Dara, in the borderlands

00:05:24.866 --> 00:05:27.066
that guard the world
from The Blight beyond.

00:05:27.066 --> 00:05:30.633
Incidentally, this is Lan’s hometown,
in fact he’s Lan Mandragoran,

00:05:30.633 --> 00:05:33.933
heir to the throne of a kingdom 
that was lost to The Blight many years ago.

00:05:33.933 --> 00:05:36.866
Lan is the strong silent type,
and Nynaeve’s the standoffish type,

00:05:36.866 --> 00:05:38.700
so these two get it on!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.233
By the way, Rand and Egwene 
are a longstanding couple,

00:05:41.233 --> 00:05:42.700
but they've been separated
this whole time,

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.000
and now they fight over nothing 
because Rand’s kind of whiny.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.800
But he apologizes and they 
get back together, they’re in love.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.566
But now Moiraine gives 
the kids the bad news,

00:05:49.566 --> 00:05:53.300
At The Dark One’s prison, whoever 
is not The Dragon, will 100% die.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:56.566
So Moiraine visits a bartender here
named Min who can read people's futures

00:05:56.566 --> 00:05:58.633
in hopes that she can tell
which one is The Dragon.

00:05:58.633 --> 00:06:00.166
She says she can't tell, but later, 

00:06:00.166 --> 00:06:03.000
while Rand is doing some late 
night archery, he has an epiphany...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.233
This whole time he's been channeling
the One Power without realizing!

00:06:06.233 --> 00:06:09.566
So he goes to see Min, who’s like 
“Yeah kid, I know you, I saw your birth.”

00:06:09.566 --> 00:06:12.166
There's a race of desert warrior
people called the Aiel,

00:06:12.166 --> 00:06:15.000
who all have pale skin and red hair 
- like you do in the desert. 

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.100
This Aiel warrior was fighting 
super pregnant, 

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.600
and oh, the baby's coming right now!

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:20.233
She was found by one of 
the enemy soldiers,

00:06:20.233 --> 00:06:22.933
yeah that's Rand’s shepherd dad, 
Tam al’Thor

00:06:22.933 --> 00:06:25.900
His mom died in childbirth, so he 
took Rand home to raise as his own.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.766
“So wait, does that mean I'm The Dragon?”

00:06:27.766 --> 00:06:29.500
“Yeah? I don't know, I-- probably.” 

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.266
So to save his friends he grabs Moiriane, 

00:06:31.266 --> 00:06:34.100
and the two of them go off alone 
to venture through the Blight.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:37.666
But now that Rand’s close, he gets a 
dream visit from The Dark One himself...

00:06:37.666 --> 00:06:40.133
who's like, “Hey, man, 
I'm actually just a normal dude.”

00:06:40.133 --> 00:06:41.700
It's like “Hey, Dragon,
good to see you again.”

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:44.366
But he’s pretty disappointed Rand 
doesn't remember his past life.

00:06:44.366 --> 00:06:49.000
But we get to see a brief flashback to 
3000 years ago, at the end of the last Age,

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.133
when the world was like a 
super advanced, magical utopia.

00:06:52.133 --> 00:06:56.466
And The Dragon was this guy, Lews Therin,
who was a male Aes Sedai,

00:06:56.466 --> 00:06:59.066
yeah back then the male part of 
The Power wasn't corrupted.

00:06:59.066 --> 00:07:02.933
Apparently him sealing The Dark One 
is what corrupted it, and then “broke the world”.

00:07:02.933 --> 00:07:06.566
And so we come to the Dark One’s
prison at the Eye of the World.

00:07:06.566 --> 00:07:08.466
He seal’s weak enough that he 
can manifest here,

00:07:08.466 --> 00:07:11.000
Moiraine tries to fight him 
but he's way too strong,

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.900
Stills her immediately, 
cuts her off from Magic!

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:17.300
Rand falls into a vision coma, where he 
and Egwene are living a happy simple life.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.433
The Dark One’s like, “Yeah man,
this can be real...”

00:07:19.433 --> 00:07:21.066
“all you have to do is free me.”

00:07:21.066 --> 00:07:23.933
Meanwhile, The Dark One’s Trollocs 
are invading Fal Dara,

00:07:23.933 --> 00:07:26.200
And long story short,
the army is totally wrecked.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:29.500
So it's up to the king’s sister who's an Aes Sedai, 
and gathers up Egwene and Nynaeve

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:33.300
and any women who can channel, and 
they all work together to do a big spell

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:35.166
that Blam! Destroys the whole army!

00:07:35.166 --> 00:07:36.833
But there's a good reason
they didn't lead with that,

00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:39.333
because channeling that much power 
burns you up and kills you.

00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:42.533
But Nynaeve is somehow able to take 
Egwene’s share of the Power herself,

00:07:42.533 --> 00:07:45.033
to save Egwene, and Nynaeve dies!

00:07:45.033 --> 00:07:47.833
Over in dreamland, Rand looks like 
he’s going to take The Dark One’s deal,

00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:49.966
But wait, what's this? 
“Sike, bro!”

00:07:49.966 --> 00:07:53.666
“Yeah I'm going to put you back
in your prison,” and the day is... saved?

00:07:53.666 --> 00:07:55.533
But the physical seal is all cracked now, 

00:07:55.533 --> 00:07:57.800
which sure doesn't seem like 
it was strengthened...

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.400
And back at the fort, they were pulling 
their magic item out of storage

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:03.033
When oh, they’re all killed! 
By none other than...

00:08:03.033 --> 00:08:05.866
Padan Fain, the peddler 
from the beginning!

00:08:05.866 --> 00:08:08.233
Yes, he's a Dark Friend who's been 
following them this whole time,

00:08:08.233 --> 00:08:10.833
And he's like “Yeah, this ain't over, 
we're just getting started...”

00:08:10.833 --> 00:08:13.266
“This series was 14 books.”

00:08:13.266 --> 00:08:15.600
So as season 1 comes to an end, 
Perrin grabs an axe,

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.866
but he's committed now to the 
nonviolent Way of the Leaf.

00:08:17.866 --> 00:08:22.066
And on his way out Padan Fain grabbed 
Matt's cursed dagger! So watch out for that.

00:08:22.066 --> 00:08:24.100
Matt himself is just chillin back in the city,

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.066
but the actor's been recast,
so he'll look different.

00:08:26.066 --> 00:08:29.800
Egwene is mourning Nynaeve’s death, 
but oh, she manages to heal her somehow!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.466
So actually Nynaeve’s fine.

00:08:31.466 --> 00:08:33.566
And Rand al’Thor, the Dragon Reborn,

00:08:33.566 --> 00:08:36.366
He's like “Wait, now that I channeled 
magic, am I going to go crazy?”

00:08:36.366 --> 00:08:38.266
And Moiraine’s like 
“Yeah, I mean, probably.”

00:08:38.266 --> 00:08:41.400
So to save his friends from himself, 
he's like “Tell them I died here.”

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:44.766
And Rand's going off on his own! 
To just... be on his own.

00:08:44.766 --> 00:08:47.133
And there's a final teaser
on the other side of the continent

00:08:47.133 --> 00:08:51.700
that's now facing an invasion
from a mysterious power across the sea!

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:55.000
They use channelers in warfare 
to make a big tidal wave,

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.100
And that's where Wheel of Time 
season one comes to an end.

00:08:58.933 --> 00:09:01.266
If you liked this Recap, 
hit that subscribe button,

00:09:01.266 --> 00:09:04.266
or more of the best Recaps 
of TV and movies.

